A2A

A2A = Agent2Agent

A2A refers to protocols designed for communication between AI agents.

Instead of:

Agent → Tool

you can have:

Agent A → Agent B

Example:

Research Agent
      ↓
Financial Agent
      ↓
Report Agent

Each agent can specialize in a particular task.

MCP vs A2A

Very important interview question.

MCP	A2A
Agent ↔ Tools/Resources	Agent ↔ Agent
Connects capabilities	Enables agent collaboration
Tool/resource access	Agent communication
Example: database tool	Example: research agent

Simple memory trick:

MCP = Agent uses tools

A2A = Agents talk to agents
